# Backlog

> User stories live here. They are written by the user and are deliberately
> coarse: a want, the value behind it and what is already known. Do not turn
> this file into a specification.
>
> The orchestrator derives activities and tasks from a story **only after it is
> selected**. Fifty stories do not produce eighty activities up front.

## Status legend

| Status               | Meaning                                                   |
| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |
| `pending`            | Not selected. No activities exist for it.                 |
| `active`             | The only story being worked on. Activities are derived.   |
| `awaiting-approval`  | Work is finished and waiting for the user's verdict.      |
| `done`               | User-approved and closed.                                 |
| `dropped`            | Deliberately discarded; keep it for context.              |

Exactly one story may be `active` and one may be `awaiting-approval`.

